        "action_date": "2025-01-09",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Rural Telehealth and Education Enhancement Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill reauthorizes the Distance Learning and Telemedicine Program through FY2030. This&nbsp;Department of Agriculture&nbsp;program provides grants to help rural communities gain the technology and training necessary to engage in telemedicine and distance learning.</p>",
